<rml>
<head>
	<title>Duel spectators (CDuelWatchUserListWindow)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="duel_watch_spectators.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="duel_watch_spectators">
	<!-- The spectators of the watched duel (CDuelWatchUserListWindow), shown with the spectator
	     frame: a 57 x 17 box per name, 18 apart, stacked upwards from the frame's top at the
	     window's x (the first name on top). A LayoutMode::Hud window, so .screen is the 640x480
	     reference screen stretched W/640 x H/480; the names take their native size and cancel the
	     stretch. Takes no pointer events (C++ keeps the pointer over the boxes from the world). -->
	<div class="screen" data-style-transform="'scale(' + scale_x + ', ' + scale_y + ')'" data-style---root-scale="scale_x" data-style---root-scale-y="scale_y">
		<div class="box" data-for="s : spectators" data-style-left="panel_x + 'px'" data-style-top="s.top + 'px'">
			<span class="name counter-scaled-xy" data-style-top="text_top + 'px'" data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'">{{s.name}}</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
